ng, and a 4pc bath. The primary suite features a 5pc ensuite with double sinks, soaker tub and separate standup shower. The finished basement adds a bedroom, rec room, 4pc bath with jetted tub and bar. Enjoy a large deck, spacious backyard, and double attached garage. Surround sound wired throughout the house. Close to Anthony Henday, public transport, schools, parks, shopping, and other major amenities! (id:67522)","facts":[["Price","$699,900"],["Type","House"],["Bedrooms","4"],["Bathrooms","4"],["Half bathrooms","1"],["Living area","2,343 sq ft"],["Year built","2006"],["Storeys","2"],["Neighbourhood","Chambery"],["Town","Edmonton"],["Postal code","T5X6J3"],["MLS® number","E4505473"],["Listed","August 25, 2026"]],"features":[["Appliances","Washer, Refrigerator, Dishwasher, Stove, Dryer, Microwave Range Hood Combo, Window Coverings"],["Heating","Forced air, In Floor Heating"],["Fireplace","Gas"],["Basement","Finished, Full"],["Parking","Attached Garage"],["Community","Public Swimming Pool"]],"rooms":[["Living room","Main level","3.96 m × 5.76 m (13'0\" × 18'11\")"],["Dining room","Main level","2.85 m × 4.55 m (9'4\" × 14'11\")"],["Kitchen","Main level","2.99 m × 4.55 m (9'10\" × 14'11\")"],["Den","Main level","3.95 m × 3.00 m (13'0\" × 9'10\")"],["Primary Bedroom","Upper Level","3.96 m × 4.55 m (13'0\" × 14'11\")"],["Bedroom 2","Upper Level","3.43 m × 3.92 m (11'3\" × 12'10\")"],["Bedroom 3","Upper Level","4.26 m × 3.02 m (14'0\" × 9'11\")"],["Bedroom 4","Basement","3.82 m × 4.14 m (12'6\" × 13'7\")"],["Bonus Room","Upper Level","5.31 m × 4.73 m (17'5\" × 15'6\")"],["Recreation room","Basement","9.65 m × 5.38 m (31'8\" × 17'8\")"],["Laundry room","Main level","2.73 m × 2.42 m (8'11\" × 7'11\")"]],"courtesy":"Billy Assaf, REMAX River City","board":"REALTORS® Association of Edmonton","town_slug":"edmonton","hood_slug":"chambery","area":"northwest-edmonton"}